{"id": 20760, "title": "My Daughter", "japanese_title": "私の娘", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "my-daughter", "audio_url": "/audio/japanese/20760_my-daughter.mp3", "english_paragraphs": ["I have a daughter who is five years old. Her name is Xiaobao. She is cute and smart.", "She gets up at seven o'clock every morning, gets dressed, washes her face, and eats. She likes eggs and milk best.", "She doesn't like school and cries every time she goes to school. She likes evenings because she can listen to me telling stories.", "I love my daughter."], "english_full": "I have a daughter who is five years old. Her name is Xiaobao. She is cute and smart.\n\nShe gets up at seven o'clock every morning, gets dressed, washes her face, and eats. She likes eggs and milk best.\n\nShe doesn't like school and cries every time she goes to school. She likes evenings because she can listen to me telling stories.\n\nI love my daughter.", "japanese_paragraphs": ["私には五歳の娘がいます。名前はシャオバオです。かわいくて、頭のいい子です。", "娘は毎朝七時に起きて、服を着て、顔を洗い、朝ごはんを食べます。卵と牛乳がいちばん好きです。", "娘は学校が嫌いで、行くたびに泣きます。でも、夜は私のお話を聞けるので好きです。", "私は娘が大好きです。"], "reading_paragraphs": ["わたし には ごさい の むすめ が います。 なまえ は しゃおばお です。 かわいくて、 あたま の いい こ です。", "むすめ は まいあさ しちじ に おきて、 ふく を きて、 かお を あらい、 あさごはん を たべます。 たまご と ぎゅうにゅう が いちばん すき です。", "むすめ は がっこう が きらい で、 いく たび に なきます。 でも、 よる は わたし の おはなし を きける ので すき です。", "わたし は むすめ が だいすき です。"], "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"わたし\" data-defn=\"I/me\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">私</span><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"に\" data-defn=\"target / time / direction marker (to/at/in)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">に</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ごさい\" data-defn=\"ごさい (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">五歳</span><rt>ごさい</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\